        "original_id": "fe17d712-a5f2-5f4b-80eb-fd9d53b772ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards\n- Places: Eko Hotel and Suites, Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria, Lagos Lagoon, Atlantic Ocean, Bar Beach\n- People: Femi Jacobs, Nse Ikpe Etim, Blossom Chukwujekwu, Bayray McNwizu\n- Products: The Visit (2015 Nigerian film)\n- Concepts: Lagos geography, barrier islands, local government areas\n\nFacts:\n- The 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards was held on March 7, 2015 at the Eko Hotel and Suites in Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria.\n- Femi Jacobs won Best Actor in a Comedy at the 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards.\n- The Visit is a 2015 Nigerian film with a four-cast ensemble of Nse Ikpe Etim, Femi Jacobs, Blossom Chukwujekwu, and Bayray McNwizu.\n- Lagos initially emerged as a port city on a collection of islands in the present-day local government areas of Lagos Island, Eti-Osa, Amuwo-Odofin, and Apapa.\n- The islands of Lagos are separated by creeks at the southwest mouth of Lagos Lagoon and are protected from the Atlantic Ocean by barrier islands and long sand spits such as Bar Beach that extend up to 100 km east and west of the mouth.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
